634 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Book of the Ten Thousand Things challenges human\055centered authorship by recognizing a nonhuman author\204the Theaterschlag in Karlsaue Park\056 The project treated the site as a living archive\054 with participants conducting sensorial readings to engage with nonhuman entities\056 The final presentation was staged not just for humans but for nonhuman audiences as well\056\n\nThis inspired me to rethink storytelling from a nonhuman perspective\054 decenter the human viewpoint\054 exploring how different species perceive and interact with their environment\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 635 0 R
     /Pg 610 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

