638 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My work is a CG film structured in chapters\054 with each chapter exploring different challenges faced by humans and other species in coexistence\056\n\nThrough key narrative settings\054 the film examines critical issues in human\055nonhuman interactions\054 prompting the audience to reconsider how ecosystems function and to reflect on the limitations of an anthropocentric perspective\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 639 0 R
     /Pg 610 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

